  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 24,
   "id": "eefc4a78",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "seuil inferieur est: 53.0\n",
      "----------------------------------------\n",
      "seuil superieur est: 69.0\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "seuil_inf_iqr = Q1 - 1.5 * iqr\n",
    "print(\"seuil inferieur est:\", seuil_inf_iqr)\n",
    "print(\"----------------------------------------\")\n",
    "\n",
    "seuil_sup_iqr = Q3 + 1.5 * iqr\n",
    "print(\"seuil superieur est:\", seuil_sup_iqr)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "14a2021a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "6.\tCalculer les Seuils supérieurs et inférieurs de la méthode de Tukey:"
